# 单向：~/Obsidian/Sparky/How-to-set-a-task-on-Sparky.md → ~/sparky-toolbox/How-to-set-a-task-on-Sparky.md（仓库这份不要直接改，会被覆盖）
[Unit]
Description=sparky-toolbox manual sync (copy Obsidian copy into repo root)

[Service]
UMask=0022
Type=oneshot
ExecStart=/bin/sh -c 'src=%h/Obsidian/Sparky/How-to-set-a-task-on-Sparky.md; dst=%h/sparky-toolbox/How-to-set-a-task-on-Sparky.md; [ -s "$src" ] && ! cmp -s "$src" "$dst" && cp "$src" "$dst.tmp" && mv "$dst.tmp" "$dst"; exit 0'
